BIB                 14         44
TITLE      Neutron-induced cross-section measurements for natSn
            and 65Cu isotopes with comprehensive covariance
            analysis at 14.96 MeV
AUTHOR     (S.Sharma, S.Shaw, Vandana, N.L.Singh, M.Mehta,
            M.Abhangi, R.Kumar, H.Sharma, S.Vala, R.K.Singh,
            R.J.Makwana, R.D.Chauhan, H.Bhuyan, K.Katovsky,
            P.Bangotra)
INSTITUTE  (3INDGND,3INDBDA)
           (3INDIND) Netaji Subhas University of Technology,
            Dwarka, New Delhi
           (3INDIND) Delhi Skill and Entrepreneurship University,
            Dwarka, New Delhi
           (3INDIND) Homi Bhabha National Institute,
            Anushaktinagar, Mumbai
           (3CZRCZR) Brno University of Technology, Brno
REFERENCE  (J,RPC,244,113746,2026)
           #doi:10.1016/j.radphyschem.2026.113746
FACILITY   (NGEN,3INDGND) Neutron and Ion Irradiation Facility
INC-SOURCE (D-T) A deuterium ion beam of energy 200 keV with beam
            current 2.5 mA, average neutron yield
            of 8.35 x 10**9 n/sec.
SAMPLE     The natSn pellet (0.1694 g weight, 0.0102 cm thick,
            99.9% purity)
           The natCu pellet (0.5068 g weight, 0.111 cm thick,
            99.5% purity)
           Al metal foil (0.0834 g weight, 0.025 cm thick)
DETECTOR   (HPGE) Detector with a resolution of <=2.1 keV at
             1332 keV gamma-ray energy of 60Co.
MONITOR    (13-AL-27(N,A)11-NA-24,,SIG)
DECAY-MON  (11-NA-24,14.95HR,DG,1368.6,0.9999)
CORRECTION Corrected for:
           . gamma-ray self attenuation,
           . neutron fluctuation factor,
           . geometry correction factor
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-T) The total uncertainty propagated from :
           (MONIT-ERR) Monitor cross section
           (ERR-1) Counts under the photo peak
           (ERR-2) Detector efficiency
           (ERR-3) Atomic mass
           (ERR-4) Half-life
           (ERR-7) Self-attenuation correction factor
           (ERR-8) Geometry correction factor
STATUS     (TABLE,,S.Sharma+,J,RPC,244,113746,2026) Table 5 and 7
HISTORY    (20260820C) A.Gandhi
